{"server":"tw","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_03_end","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_03","title":"早芒種","storyCode":"HS-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"93cc7124b6dbc9567fbfbee03a596a4ea01eb1ed3c942deb501457dbad3478d4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"左樂逼問績回到大荒城的目的，績卻表現得無所隱瞞，有恃無恐。另一方面，先前的洪澇災害似乎在大荒城內引發了一些奇異的現象。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"績先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是……左公子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次見面，沒什麼準備，有失禮數了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識我……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇異的織物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的長鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左樂右手習慣性摸向平時腰間掛刀的位置，卻只摸到一個用來操作農耕裝置的天師儀。\n這一細小的動作似乎沒能逃過男人的眼睛，他嘴角掛上笑意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子不必緊張，只是一些無害的小玩意兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“紡因織果，裁虛為實”……這些東西，是你的造物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉手之勞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇異的織物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人輕輕揮了揮手，古怪的生物頃刻間化為縷縷細碎的絲線，繼而灰飛煙滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們巨獸代理人的能力，始終讓人難以琢磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是些雕蟲繡花的功夫，能派上用場的地方不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澇災過後，緊跟著的就是蟲害和病害。看不見摸不著的災害難對付，織成實際物件，再去消滅就容易多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓姐姐看到我做這種事，又要責備我“逆天而行”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本不該出現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也算是我兒時待過的地方，許多年沒有回來過了，有些想念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你們這樣的存在，竟然也會有“兒時”這樣的概念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論壽命長短，人都有蒙昧無知的時候。那時候見到的新奇事物，印象也會更深一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一直陪在身邊的人，也總會多掛念一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾位兄弟姐妹的會面是大事，事先都應該通報司歲台才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷補給的車隊被天災攔在了半路上，我收到那位老天師的消息後，可是立刻自掏腰包送了這一批應急的貨物來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到這裡，我也只是匆匆看了姐姐一眼，那兩位妹妹的面都沒有見過。司歲台未免有點不近“人”情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生在司歲台的名單裡，是需要專注盯防的一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這些年，我從來沒有做過一件違背規矩的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不該由先生說了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可左公子現在，不是也沒穿著秉燭人的制服？"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的男人笑了笑，溫和，禮貌，從容。\n左樂卻難自制地感到了一股寒意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實在下久聞左公子玉名。今日終於得以一見，便想或許可以和左公子交個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用這樣客套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些年逗留百灶，見過不少世家子弟。只論文章才學，其中也有不少人堪稱青年才俊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但能真正像左公子這樣肯踏踏實實做點實事的人，恐怕按學宮的名單挨個數也數不出幾位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年十一月，瑯珆山海眾勾連匪患，左公子孤身涉險，救出了被困匪窩的數十無辜百姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年初二月，為了追查那件特殊的酒盞，路上又是兇險無數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知情的外人只道左公子年紀輕輕身居要職是蒙父輩蔭庇，又哪能想到秉燭人的任務有多麼兇險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子之前的所有努力，難道因為一次失誤就要被全盤否定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情……你沒有理由知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意人，為了通曉行情，總是習慣多方打聽。打聽到的東西偶爾也能當作貨物販賣。就看客人願意出多少價錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要知道，什麼樣的客人會願意為什麼情報付什麼價錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，我還知道大荒城北邊的河對岸藏著什麼，年在這裡造的那件工程到底有什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還知道，玉門遭遇天災一事，你始終懷疑有更高位者從中做梗，但遲遲抓不住線索，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道先生行事周密，滴水不漏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可司歲台也絕非無能之輩，但凡有任何蛛絲馬跡，司歲台都會一查到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下敬告先生，不要做踰矩之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是左公子作為朋友的提醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我身為司歲台秉燭人的忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想左公子應該是多慮了……整個炎國最精銳的天師盡數留守在大荒城北邊的天機閣裡，我一個人又能掀起什麼風浪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起在下，此時此刻，還是這條河對岸的那些邪祟詭魔，更該讓人擔心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子大概還不知道，最近三個月以來，天機閣已經死了多少天師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休要蠱惑人心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意人誠信為本，我從來不說假話。左公子要是不信，不如自己先去查查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再好好想一想，自己想要做什麼。要不要也來找我做一筆交易。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都和往常一樣。\n風聲靜悄悄的。\n牧獸低下頭去吃草。\n女孩環顧四周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"綿綿也是個笨牧獸，每次都跟他說不許亂跑，就是記不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾也是個笨牧獸……吹過的曲子都記不住，笨死了！再也不跟他玩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寬大的葉片層層疊疊，密得幾乎看不見天，風送來稻子的清香。\n土地潮濕，女孩向前深一腳淺一腳地踩在地上，撥開遮擋住天空的葉片，往前走著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"綿綿——回家啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"綿綿！你怎麼又在亂跑？快回棚裡去，不然我也要被挨罵了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"微風輕拂，牧獸的眼睛水汪汪的，寬大的瞳孔烏黑烏黑，映出天空、雲彩、稻田。\n小滿在牧獸眼中看到了自己的倒影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再吃草了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是……小禾最近又做出來什麼奇奇怪怪的飼料了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去跟他說說，馬上就給你們改善伙食！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，很可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下來，會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要跟我們一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說前幾天的洪水嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕，洪水都已經過去了，我可以為你們造更堅固的房子，再大的天災來了你們都不用怕，我會保護好你們的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個東西是從河對岸來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧獸的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你腳下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的腳下……怎麼了……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿在牧獸眼中看到了自己的倒影。\n微風輕拂，牧獸的眼睛水汪汪的，寬大的瞳孔烏黑烏黑，映出天空、雲彩、稻田。\n女孩環顧四周。\n牧獸低下頭去吃草。\n風聲靜悄悄的。\n一切都和往常一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g7_fieldhouse"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯，您這是在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搬樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搬樹？這桃樹在這裡長得好好的，您怎麼突然要搬它？之前那些土木天師們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫個忙，把這些土堆到旁邊去……那些人已經回工廠裡，等一下子就開著車過來運材料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都知道了，這些地是保不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，你平常和大家都熟，又是天師府的學生，你能不能給我們句實話，這片地到底出了什麼問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，大人物眼裡這一畝三分地都是生意，改成移動地塊要花多少錢，又能賺多少錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是我們的家！我們祖祖輩輩都住這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"張口閉口就是讓我們不要這種了這麼多年的地方，怎可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是……我的家……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯，我保證，我一定會搞清楚這裡發生了什麼問題，我會想辦法，保下這些地的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子的保證有什麼用，他們之前要蓋移動城市的時候，還保證會搬走這些田呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，算了。地軋了就軋了，我全當被天災給毀了，這樹我必須挖走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樹是我爺爺的奶奶種在這裡的……住在移動城市裡的人覺得“家”是可以搬走的，那這棵樹就是我的家，我也要把它搬走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫您……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老農將桃樹扛上肩頭，腳印一步步陷入土中，他背著自己的故鄉。\n禾生托著這沉甸甸的桃樹，他回頭看向核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"樵夫的眼睛向下看著，有些無神。\n他沉默了又沉默，最後還是開了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，原來您會說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到這裡來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我養的牧獸丟了，我剛看到他了，我來找他回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡有牧獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩伸出手，指向身旁。\n腳下的水面倒映出她的身影，倒映出雲彩、天空。\n秸稈密密麻麻，卻沒有半點動物的足跡。\n女孩用力眨了眨眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……剛剛明明在這的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶你去找牧獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子請坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……寧侍郎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到這麼碰巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從尚蜀到玉門，再到這大荒城，左公子作為秉燭人一定是表現卓越，才會如此受重用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧侍郎有什麼指教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豈敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是官身相見，我就不會在這種地方約見左公子了……有一件事，只能用這種形式委託左公子幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是關於歲獸代理人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二樓五城的建設是大炎至關重要的工程，在這個時刻一座城裡聚集了四位代理人，實在是件棘手的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人想要藉機生事，後果不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧侍郎的意思是，已經知道有人想要藉機生事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城建設工程重新啟動的事，左公子聽說了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個商人的補給物資……他不該去干涉這些事務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，他回來以後，與工部的萬侍郎見過一回——左公子對這位大人有沒有印象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得……這些年他一直在負責大荒城的移動地塊建設，但是數月前，他還分出功夫去處理了玉門城的修復工作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"績，他究竟想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據記載，績、黍二人交好，千年前，兩人一同在大荒城耕作。但是不久後，他便離開了大荒城，開始經營生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他每隔數十年，就會回到大荒城一次，而他上一次回來已經是六十年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧侍郎對於這些記載倒是記得很清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你懷疑他想對大荒城不利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要先找出他當下返回大荒城的目的——這正是我想委託左公子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禮部與司歲台在處理歲獸問題上向來不合，現在寧侍郎要我來做這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那左公子自己，是什麼立場呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為秉燭人，當然是奉命行事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子是專心想當一把好刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那即便砍錯了目標，責任也不在刀上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有想過推卸責任——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那左公子可曾想過，司歲台究竟為何力主以強硬手段除“歲”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有朝一日，玉門開赴京城，兩座城市與巨獸都在炮火聲中灰飛煙滅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些流離失所的百姓，戰死的將士，難道真的只用一句“別無選擇”來帶過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道真的沒有別的手段來解決問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那寧小姐是出於什麼立場讓我做這件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非官場齟齬，只是為社稷百姓，謀一份利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“光明磊落”，左公子心裡應該會有一個答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人用手指了指靜謐的河流，水面平如鏡，讓人恍然間覺得河水變得凝固。\n水面反射著天上的雲彩，反射出女孩的臉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧獸，在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在河裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找，去下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我下去了就能看到牧獸了，我要把他帶回棚子裡去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"河道中傳來轟鳴的水聲，空氣洶湧地流動著。\n女孩向前踏出了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g13_pollutedfield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來！你會死的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雙眼有些失神的老樵夫突然高高舉起了手中的斧頭，又無力地垂了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲慟的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖師，讓我去吧！讓我去救她回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲慟的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道要怎麼對付那個東西，她陷得還不深，您讓我去，我能救回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲慟的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖師！別！她還有救！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲慟的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖師——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離那裡太近就是送死，她沒救了，你救不回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶回去吧，回去立一塊碑吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呆子！你要到哪去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……牧獸在下面，大叔指給我看了，我要去把他帶回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你像頭牧獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你罵我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我罵的就是你！你眼睛瞎了牧獸才會在下面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大嗓門你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啪！\n一大團泥直接砸向了小滿的頭，從河堤隨手抓來的淤泥糊了她滿臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……噗噗噗！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"視線卻並未像想像中那樣受阻，她仍然能夠看到眼前的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿胡亂地想從臉上把泥抹下來，濕軟的泥裡卻有兩顆堅硬的東西，正吸在她的臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我臉上為什麼有兩粒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稻子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啞巴大叔人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什麼大叔？遠遠就看到你一雙兩眼無神的眼睛準備往水裡走，你瘋了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊把它丟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿就著河水沖洗乾淨臉上的淤泥。\n不斷發牢騷的孩童回過頭，堰口後的樹林中空無一人。但她還是衝著樹林深深地望了一眼，點了點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窸窸窣窣的腳步聲漸漸遠去，回到了樹林深處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"蓋著朱紅印章的信件靜靜放在桌上最顯眼的位置，就像知道房屋主人什麼時候會回來，會以怎樣的心情看到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不願意當面和我說嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是信我，可到頭來，我們還有坐下來好好聊聊的機會嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
